#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:4
#: a799574c1d794b8da806bc8814d228d9
msgid "ESC calibration"
msgstr "ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:6
#: a0293da93305455db8de763366d18ccb
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most models of PWM based ESC (not DShot ESCs) need to be calibrated to "
"ensure that all the ESCs respond to the same input with the same speed. "
"To calibrate them they need to receive maximum PWM input when initially "
"powered on, then receive minimum PWM input when they have beeped to "
"indicate that the maximum has registered."
msgstr ""
"大多数基于 PWM 的 ESC 需要校准，以确保所有 ESC 对相同输入以相同转速响应。校准时需要在初始上电时接收最大 PWM 输入，然后在 "
"ESC 发出提示音表示已记录最大值后接收最小 PWM 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:12
#: cdf21e816b234e19bd4c9ddb1b8c85fc
msgid ""
"if ESC RPM telemetry is being used, the :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN "
"<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` parameter could be set slightly below the "
":ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM <Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` parameter to prevent takeoff attempts,"
" and subsequent flips on takeoff, if one or more motors are not spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:15
#: 89da9d92c01c4830a98e8747c61faf3e
msgid ""
"You must remove all propellers from your vehicle before doing any ESC "
"calibration. Calibrating with propellers installed is dangerous."
msgstr "进行任何 ESC 校准前，必须从飞行器上拆下所有螺旋桨。带螺旋桨进行校准是危险的。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:19
#: ab0a3f1e28e7466f94f000e3b4b40d10
msgid "ESC Calibration Procedure"
msgstr "ESC 校准流程"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:20
#: 069cc77a5927495880b63541b1a4ca29
msgid ""
"This process uses the :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL <Q_ESC_CAL>` parameter to enable "
"ESC calibration in QSTABILIZE mode. There are two modes of operation "
"available:"
msgstr "此流程使用 :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL <Q_ESC_CAL>` 参数在 QSTABILIZE 模式下启用 ESC 校准。有两种可用的操作模式："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:24
#: d3a85d5928ce4560947d47b4d4d4329e
msgid ""
"with Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 the output to the motors will come directly from the "
"throttle stick in QSTABILIZE mode when the vehicle is armed"
msgstr "设置 Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 时，在 QSTABILIZE 模式下解锁后，电机输出将直接由油门摇杆控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:26
#: 096e147779bb43fcbdb3f81693b40b88
msgid ""
"with Q\\_ESC_CAL=2 the output to the motors will be full throttle when "
"the motors are armed"
msgstr "设置 Q\\_ESC_CAL=2 时，解锁后所有四旋翼电机的输出将为最大油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:29
#: de368ca8a27c4b8a803b6d2f3dc52bd2
msgid "The process when using Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 is"
msgstr "使用 Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 的操作流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:50
#: 07b6233dd0744d6cb76257fe4806995b 268a8b37ed5c4d79b886bbdd0d2539ac
msgid "remove your propellers for safety"
msgstr "为安全起见，拆下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:51
#: 3864b293cf754f79bb817e22d1bbcf3c 639824fe6d7b408e96e25d999b290a1b
msgid ""
"power up just the flight board and not your motors. If you don't have the"
" ability to isolate power to the ESCs when on battery power then power up"
" your flight board on USB power"
msgstr "仅上电给飞控板，不给电机上电。如果无法在使用电池供电时单独隔离 ESC 的电源，则通过 USB 给飞控板供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:35
#: c7a821aecfe84153afd866cbfba74f16
msgid "set the Q\\_ESC_CAL parameter to 1"
msgstr "将 Q\\_ESC_CAL 参数设为1。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:55
#: 602aecaf053248469f45e2c54be96581 6ae87951cdc74904b8a242150655ecd3
msgid "change to QSTABILIZE mode"
msgstr "切换到 QSTABILIZE 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:56
#: 9d09d95932bf4534905adbccad7528c0 bd07e665c8b74fef974446f8a187e8a0
msgid "set the safety switch off to activate the outputs"
msgstr "关闭安全开关以激活输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:38
#: 466811b84e8948d8b166547328f9708a
msgid ""
"arm your aircraft. The PWM output on all quad motors will now be "
"controlled by your throttle stick"
msgstr "解锁飞行器。所有四旋翼电机的 PWM 输出现在将由您的油门摇杆控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:40
#: 0dbc4979bb794d0ab35ad53e5b214575
msgid "move the throttle stick to maximum"
msgstr "将油门摇杆推至最大。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:58
#: aa28c62876454e31b0a94ddd7ec00cdb e1b9b5d9e8a2490e8e3c9ed690084eaf
msgid "add power to your ESCs by connecting the battery"
msgstr "通过连接电池为 ESC 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:42
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:59
#: 10de50abfda7404e96ff29074f6dd212 2427227ae77f4e9fbeeff4be1066910a
msgid "wait for the ESCs to beep to indicate they have registered the maximum PWM"
msgstr "等待 ESC 发出提示音，表示已记录最大 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:44
#: fd740b39688d4813b8c4ac2e9eb8cd58
msgid "lower the throttle stick to zero and disarm your aircraft"
msgstr "将油门摇杆拉至最低并上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:45
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:62
#: 103c120d6f8043b1a08838a50090e294 50c32a5ff1aa4ea3b3884b967963fa5f
msgid ""
"you should hear a beep from your ESCs to indicate they have registered "
"the throttle range"
msgstr "您应该听到 ESC 发出提示音，表示已记录油门范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:48
#: 22a8d05d7f3e4d1c98fae9f89decad6f
msgid "The process when using Q\\_ESC\\_CAL=2 is"
msgstr "使用 Q\\_ESC\\_CAL=2 的操作流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:54
#: 310fb118ba2f44c596b470bd303b2eb3
msgid "set the Q\\_ESC_CAL parameter to 2"
msgstr "将 Q\\_ESC_CAL 参数设为2。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:57
#: 817cf2e5f6684cd499fd369134b6fc76
msgid ""
"arm your aircraft. The PWM output on all quad motors will now be at "
"maximum"
msgstr "解锁飞行器。所有四旋翼电机的 PWM 输出现在将为最大值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:61
#: b856958a00604cdfa8624cff460ae53a
msgid "disarm your aircraft"
msgstr "上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:65
#: c37d1e11bce94d3ea40e81ad8a5b04f5
msgid ""
"Note that using Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 can be useful for testing your motors "
"response. This is the only mode when you are able to directly control the"
" throttle level on all your motors at once. While in this mode you can "
"use a laser tachometer to test your motor speeds at different throttle "
"levels if you have one."
msgstr ""
"注意，Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 "
"可用于测试电机响应，这是唯一可以同时直接控制所有电机油门级别的模式。在此模式下，如果您有激光转速表，可以测试不同油门级别下的电机转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:71
#: 42bb0d551b884da6a50256c613963dce
msgid ""
"Be sure to set :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL<Q_ESC_CAL>` back to zero after calibrating"
" for normal operation"
msgstr "校准完成后，请务必将 :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL<Q_ESC_CAL>` 重新设为零以恢复正常操作。"

